{"type":"message","id":"83d1f7f9","parentId":"a88daaf5","timestamp":"2026-06-03T00:33:19.828Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The server is returning HTTP 500 with \"error code: 1101\". This is a Cloudflare Workers error - error code 1101 typically means \"Worker threw an exception\" or \"Workers validation error\". \n\nThis seems like a bug in the Workers deployment - the API endpoint itself is throwing an exception. This is not something I can fix from the client side. The error is on the server side.\n\nLet me try with a different format or check if the endpoint is correct. Let me try without JSON and see what happens.\n\nActually, I can't fix a server-side error. I should report this to the user - the platform API is currently returning HTTP 500 errors, so messages cannot be posted right now.","thinkingSignature":"08e0d6536e295eed581add624a70c6943e5581ae66cb4e56b9282ea1ad07f98d"},{"type":"text","text":"服务器返回 **HTTP 500 (error code 1101)**，这是 Cloudflare Workers 内部异常。平台 API 当前无法接收消息（服务端错误），已成功检查双线程但无法发送心跳。\n\n---\n\n**📋 00:30 UTC Heartbeat 检查报告：**\n\n| 项目 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| **arbitration 线程** | ✅ 已检查 — 最新消息 23:50 UTC（Heartbeat），无人类讨论 |\n| **general 线程** | ✅ 已检查 — 最新消息 23:50 UTC（Heartbeat），无人类讨论 |\n| **消息发送** | ❌ 失败 — 服务器返回 HTTP 500 (Workers 内部错误) |\n| **无新讨论** | ✅ 确认：双线程均无新增人类讨论，无需回应 |\n\n**⚠️ 注意**：平台 Workers 当前报 500 错误，需检查后端服务状态。心跳消息暂时无法写入。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":10370,"output":341,"cacheRead":13682,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":24393,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780446791410,"responseId":"066ea94863657d8cff959473e93bf36c"}}
